     A* ==========================================================
     A* ARAGPRTF - 売掛金年齢表 印刷ファイル
     A* 修正#AGE: 新規作成
     A* ==========================================================
     A          R PHEAD                     SKIPB(3)
     A                                    55'売掛金年齢表' HIGHLIGHT
     A                                   112'ページ'
     A                                   120PAGNBR EDTCDE(Z)
     A                                     2'基準日'
     A                                      SPACEB(2)
     A            PBASE         10A       10
     A                                   100'作成日'
     A                                   108DATE(*SYS) EDTCDE(Y)
     A                                     2'顧客コード'
     A                                      SPACEB(2)
     A                                    23'顧客名'
     A                                    49'未収合計'
     A                                    65'期限内'
     A                                    79'1-30日'
     A                                    92'31-60日'
     A                                   106'61-90日'
     A                                   121'91日超'
     A                                     2'--------------------------'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                    28'--------------------------'
     A                                    54'--------------------------'
     A                                    80'--------------------------'
     A                                   106'-----------------------'
     A* 顧客別
     A          R PDETAIL                   SPACEB(1)
     A            PCUSTCD       20A        2
     A            PCUSTNM       22O       23
     A            PAMT0         10S 0     46EDTCDE(1)
     A            PAMT1         10S 0     60EDTCDE(1)
     A            PAMT2         10S 0     74EDTCDE(1)
     A            PAMT3         10S 0     88EDTCDE(1)
     A            PAMT4         10S 0    102EDTCDE(1)
     A            PAMT5         10S 0    116EDTCDE(1)
     A* 合計と構成比
     A          R PTOTAL                    SPACEB(2)
     A                                    23'合計'
     A            PTOT0         10S 0     46EDTCDE(1)
     A            PTOT1         10S 0     60EDTCDE(1)
     A            PTOT2         10S 0     74EDTCDE(1)
     A            PTOT3         10S 0     88EDTCDE(1)
     A            PTOT4         10S 0    102EDTCDE(1)
     A            PTOT5         10S 0    116EDTCDE(1)
     A                                    23'構成比(%)'
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A            PPCT0          4S 1     53EDTWRD(' 0 . ')
     A            PPCT1          4S 1     67EDTWRD(' 0 . ')
     A            PPCT2          4S 1     81EDTWRD(' 0 . ')
     A            PPCT3          4S 1     95EDTWRD(' 0 . ')
     A            PPCT4          4S 1    109EDTWRD(' 0 . ')
     A            PPCT5          4S 1    123EDTWRD(' 0 . ')
